   - If the human engineer clicks `Approve`, the runtime injects an observation token: `<observation>APPROVED: Operator usr_ops94 authorized action at 14:22:04Z. Executing.</observation>` and resumes the ReAct loop.
   - If `Reject`, the runtime injects `<observation>REJECTED: Operator denied action. Reason: Maintenance window required.</observation>`, compelling the agent's next thought step to formulate a non-destructive alternative.

